<span id="A1.T16.2.6.2.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T16.2.6.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">A:</span> The user likely intends to view detailed information or a complete list of their past workout activities, specifically the ”Latest: Karate Power Fat Burn” session recorded on 8/25/2024 at 20:27, as the label ”Show all” suggests an expansion or summary of historical data.</span>
