<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p3.pic1.p46" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p3.pic1.p46.1" class="ltx_p">    """Performs a swipe action on the screen. The `from_coord` and `to_coord` specify the starting and ending coordinates of the swipe. If `to_coord` is not provided, the `direction` and `amount` parameters are used to determine the swipe direction and distance. The `direction` can be ’up’, ’down’, ’left’, or ’right’, and the `amount` specifies how far to swipe relative to the screen size (0 to 1)."""</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p3.pic1.2.47" class="ltx_p" style="width:366.2pt;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p3.pic1.2.47.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:366.2pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p3.pic1.2.47.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p3.pic1.p47" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p3.pic1.p47.1" class="ltx_p">    pass</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p3.pic1.2.48" class="ltx_p" style="width:366.2pt;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p3.pic1.2.48.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:366.2pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p3.pic1.2.48.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;"></span></span></span>
