<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.99" class="ltx_p" style="width:366.2pt;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.99.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:366.2pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.99.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.p99" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.p99.1" class="ltx_p">&lt;/action&gt;</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.100" class="ltx_p" style="width:366.2pt;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.100.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:366.2pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.100.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.101" class="ltx_p" style="width:366.2pt;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.101.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:366.2pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.101.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.p101" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.p101.1" class="ltx_p">## Note</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.102" class="ltx_p" style="width:366.2pt;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.102.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:366.2pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.102.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.p102" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.p102.1" class="ltx_p">- Avoid action(s) that would lead to invalid states.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.103" class="ltx_p" style="width:366.2pt;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.103.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:366.2pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.103.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.p103" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.p103.1" class="ltx_p">- The generated action(s) must exist within the defined action space.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.104" class="ltx_p" style="width:366.2pt;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.104.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:366.2pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.104.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.104.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.2.104.1.3" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.p104" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p4.pic1.p104.1" class="ltx_p">- The generated operation and action(s) should be enclosed within &lt;operation&gt;&lt;/operation&gt; and &lt;action&gt;&lt;/action&gt; tags, respectively.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
