<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p5.pic1.p107.1" class="ltx_p">- Avoid actions that would lead to invalid states.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p5.pic1.2.108" class="ltx_p" style="width:366.2pt;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p5.pic1.2.108.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:366.2pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p5.pic1.2.108.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p5.pic1.p108" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p5.pic1.p108.1" class="ltx_p">- The generated action(s) must exist within the defined action space.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p5.pic1.2.109" class="ltx_p" style="width:366.2pt;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p5.pic1.2.109.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:366.2pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p5.pic1.2.109.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p5.pic1.2.109.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p5.pic1.2.109.1.3" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p5.pic1.p109" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.SS9.SSS1.p5.pic1.p109.1" class="ltx_p">- The reasoning process, operation and action(s) in your response should be enclosed within &lt;think&gt;&lt;/think&gt;, &lt;operation&gt;&lt;/operation&gt; and &lt;action&gt;&lt;/action&gt; tags, respectively</span>
</span></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></svg></span>
